n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n**Fixes #111082** \r\n\r\n**Current Behavior** \r\nIt does not store the locked transform information specific to each object and shares the same with the same node type if under the same parent node.\r\n\r\n**New Behavior** \r\nThis pr aims to modify the key that is used to store the link , it stored according to class only , i have attached another string for the instance id of the node for the private functions . And the transform info is different across the nodes of same type under the same parent .\r\n\r\n**How to test**\r\n1. Make a parent node .\r\n2. Attach 2 or 3 nodes of two types where transform lock is possible .\r\n3. Change the tranform lock for one node and check if the others are affected.\r\n\r\n**Video Demonstration**\r\n[Screencast_20251002_235754.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e425844-8c62-4618-8281-b90769c4b4dc)\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T18:44:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:45Z","closed_at":"2025-10-02T19:07:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"099d905c721179f4107e0535807f812cbccc0ea0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ayanakoji77:lock-unlock-state","ref":"lock-unlock-state","repo":{"id":1066410931,"node_id":"R_kgDOP5Ajsw","name":"godot","full_name":"Ayanakoji77/godot","owner":{"login":"Ayanakoji77","id":123665821,"node_id":"U_kgDOB179nQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/